<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia cash prices show little change.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia cash prices show little change.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were up slightly in central Florida on light hand-to-mouth purchases, and ammonia prices were unchanged in a quiet market, trade sources said.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-180			up 3-up 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-184			unc-dn 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		 225			unc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
